 (text ".subckt IRLZ44N_GDS g d s\nX1 d g s IRLZ44N\n.ends\n.subckt IRF4905_GDS g d s\nX1 d g s IRF4905\n.ends\n.subckt PC817_AKEC a k e c\nX1 a k c e PC817\n.ends\n.subckt DUF5408_KA k a\nD1 a k DUF5408\n.ends\n.subckt D1N5819_KA k a\nD1 a k D1N5819\n.ends\n.subckt DTVS22_KA k a\nD1 a k DTVS22\n.ends\n.subckt DZ12_KA k a\nD1 a k DZ12\n.ends\n.subckt DZ15_KA k a\nD1 a k DZ15\n.ends\n.subckt DZ20_KA k a\nD1 a k DZ20\n.ends\n.subckt DLED_KA k a\nD1 a k DLED\n.ends\n* Torpedo driver v4 - SPICE models (ngspice 42+)\n* MOSFETs: VDMOS core fitted to the IR datasheets (IRLZ44N PD-9.1346A, IRF4905 PD-91280D)\n*   - Rds(on) set to the datasheet MAXIMUM (22 mOhm @ 10 V, 20 mOhm @ -10 V), so results are conservative\n*   - Cgd (Crss) is the VDMOS non-linear Cgd (cgdmax/cgdmin/a), fitted by AC sweep to datasheet Fig. 5:\n*       IRLZ44N  669/266/148/104 pF at Vds 1/10/25/50 V (datasheet 750/280/150/110)\n*       IRF4905 2788/1107/615/434 pF at Vds 1/10/25/50 V (datasheet 2800/1100/640/450)\n*   - Cds from Coss - Crss as a junction capacitance, Cgs = Ciss - Crss\n*   - VTO is a parameter so corners can be run (IRLZ44N 1.0..2.0 V, IRF4905 -2..-4 V)\n.subckt IRLZ44N d g s PARAMS: VTO=1.75\nM1 d gi s NLZ44\nRg g gi 2\n.model NLZ44 VDMOS(vto={VTO} Kp=20 mtriode=1.25 Rd=8.6m Rs=8.6m Cgs=1.65n Cgdmax=1.2n Cgdmin=60p a=0.2\n+ Cjo=1.2n Vj=0.7 m=0.5 Is=5p N=1.2 Rb=8m BV=58 IBV=250u ksubthres=0.12)\n.ends\n.subckt IRF4905 d g s PARAMS: VTO=-3.0\nM1 d gi s PF4905\nRg g gi 2\n.model PF4905 VDMOS(pchan vto={VTO} Kp=8 mtriode=2.6 Rd=7m Rs=6.2m Cgs=2.8n Cgdmax=5n Cgdmin=250p a=0.2\n+ Cjo=3.8n Vj=1.0 m=0.5 Is=10p N=1.2 Rb=5m BV=58 IBV=250u ksubthres=0.12)\n.ends\n* Diodes\n.model D1N5819 D(Is=31.7u Rs=0.051 N=1.373 Cjo=110p M=0.35 Eg=0.69 Xti=2 BV=40 IBV=1m)\n* UF5408: 3 A ultrafast silicon, low leakage (IR 10 uA max at 1000 V, 25 C), trr 75 ns, VF 1.7 V max at 3 A\n.model DUF5408 D(Is=4n Rs=0.035 N=1.75 Cjo=45p M=0.45 Tt=60n BV=1000 IBV=10u)\n* 1N5822 kept for comparison only (Schottky leakage defeats the open-coil check)\n.model D1N5822 D(Is=30u Rs=0.05 N=1.05 Cjo=350p M=0.45 Eg=0.69 Xti=2 BV=45 IBV=1m)\n* P6KE22A: VBR 20.9-23.1 V @ 1 mA, VC 30.6 V @ 19.6 A\n.model DTVS22 D(Is=1e-12 Rs=0.44 N=1.5 BV=21.9 IBV=1m Cjo=1.5n)\n* BZX55C-series zeners (DO-35), BV at 5 mA\n.model DZ12 D(Is=1e-14 Rs=15 N=1 BV=11.9 IBV=5m Cjo=60p)\n.model DZ15 D(Is=1e-14 Rs=25 N=1 BV=14.9 IBV=5m Cjo=50p)\n.model DZ20 D(Is=1e-14 Rs=45 N=1 BV=19.9 IBV=5m Cjo=40p)\n.model DLED D(Is=1e-19 N=1.6 Rs=5 Cjo=30p)\n* PC817: LED, photo current = IF*CTR/200 into the base of a beta=200 NPN.\n* Cjc/Tr set so tr/tf at the datasheet test point (Vce=2 V, Ic=2 mA, RL=100 ohm) come out near 4 us / 3 us.\n.subckt PC817 a k c e PARAMS: CTR=1.0 CJC=15p\nDled a m DOPTO\nVs m k 0\nFph c b Vs {CTR/200}\nQp c b e QOPTO\nRbe b e 200meg\n.model DOPTO D(Is=8.4e-13 N=2 Rs=2 Cjo=30p)\n.model QOPTO NPN(Is=1e-14 Bf=200 Br=5 Vaf=100 Cjc={CJC} Cje=10p Tf=5n Tr=2u)\n.ends\n* LP2950-3.3 (or 78L33): 3.3 V, ~0.4 V dropout, 75 uA ground current. Pins: out gnd in\n.subckt LDO33 out gnd in\nBreg o1 gnd V = min(3.3, max(V(in,gnd)-0.4, 0))\nVm o1 out 0\nFin in gnd Vm 1\nIq in gnd 75u\n.ends\n* Electromechanical solenoid (plunger model). a = + terminal, b = - terminal.\n*  Electrical:  v_ab = R*i + d(lambda)/dt,  i = lambda / L(x)\n*  Magnetic:    1/L(x) = 1/LO + (1/LC - 1/LO) * x/S   (reluctance linear in the air gap)\n*               F = 0.5 * i^2 * dL/dx\n*  Mechanical:  M*dv/dt = F - (F0 + K*x + C*v) - end stops     (\"mechanical impedance\" Z = C + jwM + K/jw)\n*  Node voltages inside: lam = flux linkage [Wb], x = plunger travel [m], v = velocity [m/s]\n.subckt SOLENOID a b PARAMS: R=15 LO=25m LC=75m S=8m M=30m K=200 F0=0.8 C=2 KS=2e5 CS=100\nBi a b I = V(lam) * (1/LO + (1/LC-1/LO)*min(max(V(x),0),S)/S)\nClam lam 0 1\nBlam 0 lam I = V(a,b) - R*V(lam)*(1/LO + (1/LC-1/LO)*min(max(V(x),0),S)/S)\nCv v 0 1\nBv 0 v I = ( 0.5*pow(V(lam)*(1/LO+(1/LC-1/LO)*min(max(V(x),0),S)/S),2) * ((1/LO-1/LC)/S) / pow(1/LO+(1/LC-1/LO)*min(max(V(x),0),S)/S,2)\n+ - F0 - K*V(x) - C*V(v)\n+ - KS*max(V(x)-S,0) - CS*V(v)*u(V(x)-S)\n+ + KS*max(-V(x),0) - CS*V(v)*u(-V(x)) ) / M\nCx x 0 1\nBx 0 x I = V(v)\n.ends" (at 545.00 20.00 0) (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 2736a29d-7e11-4d44-aba6-52d0d5900506))
 (text ".tran 20u 400m" (at 20.00 272.00 0) (effects (font (size 1.778 1.778)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 1465d13f-df35-4421-b21b-5fb40ddcf975))
 (text "Same circuit and models as ../kicad/simulation (generated from the v4 PCB).\nTimeline: ARM on at 20 ms, FIRE1 on at 30 ms, FIRE1 off at 230 ms, ARM off at 330 ms.\nR30/L3 = battery and lead, R31 = fuse F2, R32 = PTC F1, R33 = C1 ESR, R40..R42 = GPIO output resistance,\nR44 = ESP32 load, R46 = ADS1115 + pull-up load on 3V3P, R45/C12 = isolation barrier. SOL1/SOL2 = electromechanical solenoid.\nPlot: V(/VSW), V(/D1N), V(/G1), V(/G3), I(SOL1), V(/SD1), V(/SBAT), and the plunger position V(xsol1.x)" (at 20.00 282.00 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 96b95031-4762-49dc-84fd-fdddbdfe17eb))
 (sheet_instances (path "/" (page "1")))
)
